# REST Client requests for svm-indexer
# VS Code extension: humao.rest-client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminPasskey = test

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin
x-Security: {{adminPasskey}}


### ---------- RPCs ----------

### Add RPC with explicit http and ws URLs
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "http_url": "https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com",
  "ws_url": "wss://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com"
}


### Add RPC with minimal payload (ws_url auto-generated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "http_url": "https://solana-mainnet.g.alchemy.com"
}


### Add RPC without protocol prefix (https:// auto-added)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "http_url": "solana-mainnet.g.alchemy2.com",
  "ws_url": "api.mainnet-beta.solana2.com"
}


### Add RPC - missing http_url (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ws_url": "wss://example.com"
}


### Add RPC without auth header (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "http_url": "https://example.com"
}


### List all RPCs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### List RPCs paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs?page=1&per_page=3
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### Get single RPC (replace 1 with an existing id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs/1
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### Update RPC (replace 1 with an existing id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs/1
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "http_url": "https://updated.example.com"
}


### Delete RPC (replace 1 with an existing id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/rpcs/1
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### ---------- Programs ----------

### Add program with a new RPC (rpc_url)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rpc_url": {
    "http_url": "https://new-program-rpc.com",
    "ws_url": "wss://new-program-rpc.com"
  },
  "name": "my-program",
  "address": "4GYvtbs7da26tLaZt9PNQWLesq2riwEN6fi9tGF91A5P"
}


### Add program tied to an existing RPC (replace rpc_id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rpc_id": 1,
  "name": "my-program",
  "address": "9oFYVPXLVyv3YchXnULcVuwGcTggK5nC4VkqjyRmSuAx"
}


### Add a shared program narrowed by account_filters (only its matching accounts get indexed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rpc_id": 1,
  "name": "token-subset",
  "address": "TokenkegQfeZyiNwAJbNbGKPFXCWuBvf9Ss623VQ5DA",
  "account_filters": {
    "data_size": 165,
    "memcmp": [{ "offset": 0, "bytes": "So11111111111111111111111111111111111111112" }]
  }
}


### Clear a program's account_filters (back to tracking every account it owns)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs/1
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_filters": {}
}


### Add program - invalid address (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rpc_id": 1,
  "address": "not-a-valid-solana-address"
}


### List all programs
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### List programs paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs?page=1&per_page=4
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### Get single program (replace 1 with an existing id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs/1
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### Update program (replace 1 with an existing id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs/1
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rpc_id": 1,
  "address": "4GYvtbs7da26tLaZt9PNQWLesq2riwEN6fi9tGF91A5P"
}


### Deactivate a program (pause indexing without deleting it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs/1/deactivate
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### Activate a program (resume indexing from last_processed_slot)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs/1/activate
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### Delete program (replace 1 with an existing id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/programs/1
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### Indexer stats (counts, per-program progress, table estimates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
x-security: {{adminPasskey}}


### ---------- Accounts (public) ----------

### Get one account's latest state
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/4GYvtbs7da26tLaZt9PNQWLesq2riwEN6fi9tGF91A5P


### Batch fetch (positional result, null where not indexed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts?addresses=4GYvtbs7da26tLaZt9PNQWLesq2riwEN6fi9tGF91A5P,So11111111111111111111111111111111111111112


### Transactions that referenced the address (getSignaturesForAddress replacement)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/4GYvtbs7da26tLaZt9PNQWLesq2riwEN6fi9tGF91A5P/transactions?since_slot=1500&page=1&per_page=20


### ---------- Program reads (public; replace 1 with a program id) ----------

### All accounts of a program
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs/1/accounts


### Program accounts filtered by memcmp (<offset>:<base58>)
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs/1/accounts?memcmp=0:3xR


### Program accounts filtered by exact data size, paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs/1/accounts?dataSize=165&page=1&per_page=25


### Program events (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs/1/events


### Program events since a slot
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs/1/events?since_slot=1500


### Program events by discriminator (leading 8 bytes, hex)
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs/1/events?discriminator=e445a52e51cb9a1d


### Program events for a single transaction
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs/1/events?tx_signature=5wHu1qwD4kLwZzQ3rZ8m9pXr7YcVn8rY3xJqk2Fh6gTn4bScP1aWfE9dMxvUoLpKq8rT2sVbNc3hGyJ7mQwErTy


### Program transactions, failed only, in a slot range
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs/1/transactions?success=false&from_slot=1000&to_slot=2000


### ---------- Transactions (public) ----------

### Single transaction by signature
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/5wHu1qwD4kLwZzQ3rZ8m9pXr7YcVn8rY3xJqk2Fh6gTn4bScP1aWfE9dMxvUoLpKq8rT2sVbNc3hGyJ7mQwErTy


### Recent transactions across all programs, since a slot
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?since_slot=1500&page=1&per_page=20


### ---------- Live streams (SSE) ----------

### Stream one account's changes
GET {{baseUrl}}/sse/accounts/4GYvtbs7da26tLaZt9PNQWLesq2riwEN6fi9tGF91A5P
Accept: text/event-stream


### Stream all account changes for a program
GET {{baseUrl}}/sse/programs/1/accounts
Accept: text/event-stream


### Stream a program's log events
GET {{baseUrl}}/sse/programs/1/events
Accept: text/event-stream
